WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.005 --> 00:00:25.974
"The king is really hungry," Cook said.

2
00:00:25.975 --> 00:00:29.105
She quickly cooked more food.

3
00:00:29.106 --> 00:00:47.771
Tom sprinkled more powder on it.

4
00:00:47.772 --> 00:00:51.622
The king and his guests ate the food.

5
00:00:51.623 --> 00:00:59.084
"More!" they cried. "More food!"

6
00:00:59.085 --> 00:01:02.846
"I am almost out of food," Cook said.

7
00:01:02.847 --> 00:01:07.974
"I am almost out of powder," Tom said.

8
00:01:07.975 --> 00:01:11.484
Dirk said, "Bring more food!

9
00:01:11.485 --> 00:01:19.800
Or you will go to the Grim Dungeon!"

10
00:01:19.801 --> 00:01:28.119
Cook and Tom looked in every cupboard.

11
00:01:28.120 --> 00:01:32.940
They found stale bread and moldy cheese.

12
00:01:32.941 --> 00:01:41.841
Tom sprinkled powder on it.

13
00:01:41.842 --> 00:01:47.080
The guests ate it.

14
00:01:47.081 --> 00:01:51.381
"The guests must be full now," Cook said.

15
00:01:51.382 --> 00:01:56.078
"I hope they don't get sick," Tom said.

16
00:01:56.079 --> 00:01:58.862
Dirk ran into the kitchen.

17
00:01:58.863 --> 00:02:06.039
"The king wants more food now!" he said.

18
00:02:06.040 --> 00:02:11.170
Cook started to cry.

19
00:02:11.171 --> 00:02:13.496
She clutched her apron.

20
00:02:13.497 --> 00:02:18.806
"The food is all gone!" she said.

21
00:02:18.807 --> 00:02:21.273
"I will help," Tom said.

22
00:02:21.274 --> 00:02:24.589
Tom waved his wand wildly.

23
00:02:24.590 --> 00:02:26.979
"Food!" he cried.

24
00:02:26.980 --> 00:02:32.365
Poof! A dead mouse appeared on the table.

25
00:02:32.366 --> 00:02:39.084
"Ick!" Cook said. "That's not food!"

26
00:02:39.085 --> 00:02:41.571
Cat saw the mouse.

27
00:02:41.572 --> 00:02:44.876
"That's my food," she said.

28
00:02:44.877 --> 00:02:47.818
"I was hunting in the pantry."

29
00:02:47.819 --> 00:02:50.506
"Sorry, Cat," Tom said.

30
00:02:50.507 --> 00:02:54.353
"My magic powder made the food taste too good.

31
00:02:54.354 --> 00:02:57.214
Everyone wants to keep eating!"

32
00:02:57.215 --> 00:03:02.041
"Hmm . . ." Cat licked her paws.

33
00:03:02.042 --> 00:03:10.132
"I might be able to help," she said.
